Package: msidataset
Title: Mass Spectrometry Imaging Dataset Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Xiaoyu", "Xu", email = "XIAOYU021@e.ntu.edu.sg", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Provides functions for creating, validating, and manipulating mass spectrometry
    imaging (MSI) datasets in R. The package includes tools for data structure
    validation, format conversion, and quality control checks specific to MSI data
    analysis workflows.
